{"3969100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Turn n' Run", "steam_appid": 3969100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.mp4?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>Turn n’ Run is a turn-based party platformer for up to 6 players, where every turn is a chance to jump, shove and roll through outrageous obstacle courses inspired by Gladiators, Ninja Warrior and Total Wipeout. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/89d76bc0a6822ed0e7388dba71b54bbd.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/89d76bc0a6822ed0e7388dba71b54bbd.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/89d76bc0a6822ed0e7388dba71b54bbd.mp4?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Details</strong><br>Matches are procedurally generated, so no two shows are ever the same.<br>Each one is a fast-paced spectacle, split across three wildly different stages, each testing a different kind of nerve:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Maze</strong> – <br>Grab items and outsmart rivals as you navigate twists, turns and traps. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/87204ba791a076b86ab4f9db6c20269d.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/87204ba791a076b86ab4f9db6c20269d.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/87204ba791a076b86ab4f9db6c20269d.mp4?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gauntlet</strong> – <br>Test your platforming skills with jumps, leaps and dodges. One slip can send you flying to the abyss.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/af333b1865e6079d433ab7b158d9b849.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/af333b1865e6079d433ab7b158d9b849.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/af333b1865e6079d433ab7b158d9b849.mp4?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Roll to the Goal</strong> – <br>Climb into a giant sphere and race to the finish, colliding with opponents along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/9d514ff63960121697f748e473c02266.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/9d514ff63960121697f748e473c02266.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/9d514ff63960121697f748e473c02266.mp4?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>With a mix of strategy, daring moves and pure chaos, every turn is unpredictable and hilarious.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based party fun for 2–6 players, local or online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three-stage obstacle courses blending mazes, platforming and giant spheres</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items and power-ups to boost yourself or sabotage your rivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated courses for endless variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colourful, stylised visuals and tongue-in-cheek game show humour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly gameplay full of laughter, chaos and competitive thrills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.mp4?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.mp4?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>Turn n’ Run is a turn-based party platformer for up to 6 players, where every turn is a chance to jump, shove and roll through outrageous obstacle courses inspired by Gladiators, Ninja Warrior and Total Wipeout. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/89d76bc0a6822ed0e7388dba71b54bbd.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/89d76bc0a6822ed0e7388dba71b54bbd.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/89d76bc0a6822ed0e7388dba71b54bbd.mp4?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Details</strong><br>Matches are procedurally generated, so no two shows are ever the same.<br>Each one is a fast-paced spectacle, split across three wildly different stages, each testing a different kind of nerve:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul clas