.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/9d514ff63960121697f748e473c02266.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/9d514ff63960121697f748e473c02266.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/9d514ff63960121697f748e473c02266.mp4?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>With a mix of strategy, daring moves and pure chaos, every turn is unpredictable and hilarious.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based party fun for 2–6 players, local or online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three-stage obstacle courses blending mazes, platforming and giant spheres</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items and power-ups to boost yourself or sabotage your rivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated courses for endless variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colourful, stylised visuals and tongue-in-cheek game show humour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly gameplay full of laughter, chaos and competitive thrills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.poster.avif?t=1779778822\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.webm?t=1779778822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969100/extras/6e9f284c3e080b1a230a023d5c6e1b79.mp4?t=1779778